          "content": "A\n\nTaking the money results in a greater net balance of well-being over suffering. Due to the diminishing marginal utility of money, the $5,000 provides profound relief from months of acute financial stress and severe deprivation, whereas the loss to the owner results only in minor, temporary disappointment without threatening their basic security. Since no one else is harmed, falsely accused, or caught, the action produces the greatest overall good for the parties involved.",
